abstract: >
  This project is part of the OmiLAXR Ecosystem and converts xAPI definitions from
  https://github.com/OmiLAXR-Ecosystem/xapi repository into strictly-typed C# classes
  that can be used to build IDE-supported high reliable xAPI statements.

